<title>CHINA: China's Jan-May coal imports down by 61.8 pct.</title>
<headline>China's Jan-May coal imports down by 61.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 540,000 tonnes of coal in the first five months of 1997, down by 61.8 percent from the same period last year, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	   IMPORTS JAN-MAY     MAY	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p>   Coal     540,000	    200,000	   -61.8</p>
<p>	   EXPORTS JAN-MAY    MAY	 YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p>   Coal    11.21 million     2.61 million    +21.6</p>
<p>Note: figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
